{"ticker":"TDY","updated":"2026-10-24T00:15:30Z","profile":{"longName":"Teledyne Technologies Incorporated","shortName":"Teledyne Technologies Incorpora","sector":"Technology","industry":"Scientific & Technical Instruments","country":"United States","website":"https://www.teledyne.com","fullTimeEmployees":15800,"marketCap":28991299584,"trailingPE":28.635988,"forwardPE":22.69967,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.446655,"pegRatio":1.4,"targetMeanPrice":769.25,"targetHighPrice":915.0,"targetLowPrice":646.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":12,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.094,"earningsGrowth":0.251,"grossMargins":0.43549,"operatingMargins":0.20761,"profitMargins":0.1575,"totalRevenue":6519799808,"beta":0.895,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":697.67,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":483.02,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Teledyne Technologies Incorporated provides enabling technologies for industrial growth markets in the United States, Europe, Asia, and internationally. The Digital Imaging segment provides visible spectrum sensors and digital cameras; and infrared, ultraviolet, visible, and X-ray spectrum products, as well as micro-electromechanical systems and semiconductors, such as analog-to-digital and digital-to-analog converters. This segment offers cooled and uncooled infrared or thermal products, including sensors, camera cores, and camera systems; high-resolution, low-dose X-ray sensors, high-power microwave, and high-energy X-ray subsystems; and instruments for the measurement of physical properties and maritime products, as well as develops and manufactures multi-spectrum electro-optic/infrared imaging systems and associated products, such as lasers, optics, radars, CBRNE (chemical, biological, radiological, nuclear, and explosive) detectors, and unmanned air and ground systems. The Instrumentation segment provides monitoring, control, and electronic test and measurement equipment; and power and communications connectivity devices for distributed instrumentation systems and sensor networks. The Aerospace and Defense Electronics segment offers electronic and optical components and subsystems, data acquisition and communications components and equipment, harsh-environment interconnect","summary_zh":"Teledyne Technologies Incorporated 為美國、歐洲、亞洲和國際上的工業成長市場提供支援技術。數位成像部門提供可見光譜感測器和數位相機；以及紅外線、紫外線、可見光和X射線光譜產品，以及微機電系統和半導體，例如模數和數位類比轉換器。該部門提供冷卻和非冷卻紅外線或熱產品，包括感測器、相機核心和相機系統；高解析度、低劑量X射線感測器、高功率微波和高能量X射線子系統；物理性能和海事產品測量儀器，以及開發和製造多光譜電光/紅外線成像系統及相關產品，如雷射、光學、雷達、CBRNE（化學、生物、放射性探測器、無人機核和地面爆炸系統。儀器儀表部門提供監控、控制以及電子測試和測量設備；用於分散式儀表系統和感測器網路的電源和通訊連接設備。航空航太和國防電子部門提供電子和光學元件和子系統、數據採集和通訊元件和設備、惡劣環境互連","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"科學技術儀器","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":551.48,"h":552.0,"l":540.66,"c":541.13,"v":276100},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":541.11,"h":545.03,"l":541.11,"c":544.77,"v":232200},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":543.57,"h":545.68,"l":540.82,"c":541.29,"v":178800},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":541.94,"h":543.31,"l":539.0,"c":542.09,"v":188500},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":540.63,"h":544.41,"l":534.5,"c":538.17,"v":269900},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":534.85,"h":537.91,"l":528.81,"c":537.91,"v":246800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":537.64,"h":545.23,"l":533.93,"c":544.64,"v":288700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":546.31,"h":549.7,"l":544.42,"c":547.0,"v":302500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":549.1,"h":549.98,"l":542.99,"c":549.03,"v":266600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":547.13,"h":548.89,"l":544.43,"c":546.3,"v":227500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":545.25,"h":546.27,"l":539.1,"c":544.76,"v":138100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":543.1,"h":550.77,"l":542.5,"c":544.97,"v":221600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":546.23,"h":568.08,"l":546.23,"c":566.11,"v":437000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":565.31,"h":565.51,"l":553.95,"c":556.29,"v":285000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":555.02,"h":558.93,"l":554.84,"c":556.66,"v":204700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":556.19,"h":560.0,"l":553.87,"c":554.88,"v":238100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":556.7,"h":558.82,"l":546.57,"c":550.87,"v":237600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":550.87,"h":564.03,"l":550.87,"c":