":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxQMmJydjM1U0t2RzZLeFV0cjZzdngyelF2RVMtdVJlbkpCTHk5My1Uc2VfZXVYaHVfNndydUtwTk5rczRTTDY5TTV1N1lvMVhGU2Jwejh3WXZzNVlwQ2ZrWEJnVzZZb0tocVhITGdWeFdoVHpvbExmcFpTSldHc3BqS2M5cjBTdlBSNUE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"Teledyne Technologies Incorpora (TDY) 2026 財年第三季財報電話會議紀錄"},{"title":"[Teledyne Technologies Q3 2026 Earnings Call] Teledyne Raises 2026 Guidance for Third Time as Digital Imaging Surges 15%, Backlog Hits $5.3 Billion","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFBkdFZyU1B3YlUxX3RlSTJ2dmZLNEtYY3BOdFRaaVZxc3pPbWVBSTJtWURmX3FDYTY4RTNXOG1iYTRJMWdGT0pmenpfWkNqYWRrM1RnRXBoUjU4TmdF?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"[Teledyne Technologies 2026 年第三季財報電話會議] Teledyne 第三次上調 2026 年業績指引，數位影像飆升 15%，積壓訂單達到 53 億美元"},{"title":"TDY Q3 FY2026 earnings call","src":"finance.biggo.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE1saDBaX2htRXplVEV4VG5fM0pKQVNjSzJ6cjB2aGNKSXI5Y1U2eVJMQ0JxNVcyYWpWUk1XTU5BZ2FBT25MRmpyVWpPM1N1eGJYU2ZuaE82QVZpLWJCQVB1NXAweEl4UHA0Zl92M2U2UEtRNGRKQWc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"TDY 2026 財年第三季財報電話會議"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":7},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-20","period":"2025-12-28","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1094285/000109428526000017/tdy-20251228.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Teledyne Technologies Incorporated is a Delaware corporation that provides enabling technologies to sense, analyze and distribute information for industrial growth markets that require advanced technology and high reliability. These markets include aerospace and defense, factory automation, air and water quality environmental monitoring, electronics design and development, oceanographic research, deepwater oil and gas exploration and production, medical imaging and pharmaceutical research. Our products include digital imaging sensors, cameras and systems within the visible, infrared and X-ray spectra, monitoring and control instrumentation for marine and environmental applications, harsh environment interconnects, electronic test and measurement equipment, aircraft information management systems, and defense electronics and satellite communication subsystems. We also supply engineered sy","zh":"Teledyne Technologies Incorporated 是一家特拉華州公司，為需要先進技術和高可靠性的工業成長市場提供感知、分析和分發資訊的支援技術。這些市場包括航空航太和國防、工廠自動化、空氣和水質環境監測、電子設計和開發、海洋學研究、深水石油和天然氣勘探和生產、醫學成像和藥物研究。我們的產品包括可見光、紅外線和 X 射線光譜範圍內的數位成像感測器、相機和系統、海洋和環境應用的監控和控制儀器、惡劣環境互連、電子測試和測量設備、飛機資訊管理系統以及國防電子和衛星通訊子系統。我們也提供工程系統"},{"en":"The following description of our business should be read together with \"Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations\" within Item 7. of this Form 10-K.","zh":"以下對我們業務的描述應與本表 10-K 第 7 項中的「管理層對財務狀況和經營業績的討論和分析」一起閱讀。"},{"en":"Consistent with our strategy, we completed four acquisitions in 2025 and two acquisitions in 2024. The financial results of these acquisitions have been included since the respective date of each acquisition. Our 2025 and 2024 acquisitions were within the Digital Imaging, Instrumentation, and Aerospace and Defense Electronics segments. See Note 3 for additional information about our 2025 and 2024 business acquisitions. Subsequent to the end of the year, we completed one acquisition which will be included within the Instrumentation segment. See Note 18 for additional information.","zh":"根據我們的策略，我們在 2025 年完成了四項收購，在 2024 年完成了兩項收購。這些收購的財務表現已自每筆收購各自的日期起納入其中。我們 2025 年和 2024 年的收購涉及數位成像、儀器儀表以及航空航太和國防電子領域。有關我們 2025 年和 2024 年業務收購的更多資訊，請參閱註釋 3。今年年底後，我們完成了一項收購，將納入儀器儀表部門。更多資訊請參閱註 18。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our businesses are aligned in four segments: Digital Imaging, Instrumentation, Aerospace and Defense Electronics, and Engineered Systems. Additional financial information about our business segments can be found in Note 4.","zh":"我們的業務分為四個領域：數位成像、儀器儀表、航空航太和國防電子以及工程系統。有關我們業務部門的其他財務資訊請參閱附註 4。"},{"en":"Our Digital Imaging segment includes high-performance sensors, cameras and systems within the visible, infrared, ultraviolet and X-ray spectra for use in industrial, scientific, government, space, defense, security, medical and other applications. We also produce and provide manufacturing services for micro electromechanical systems (\"MEMS\") and high-performance, high-reliability semiconductors, including analog-to-digital and digital-to-analog converters, as well as unmanned aerial and ground systems.","zh":"我們的數位成像部門包括可見光、紅外線、紫外線和 X 射線光譜範圍內的高性能感測器、攝影機和系統，用於工業、科學、政府、太空、國防、安全、醫療和其他應用。我們也生產並提供微機電系統（「MEMS」）和高性能、高可靠性半導體的製造服務，包括模數和數位類比轉換器，以及無人機和地面系統。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We have a broad and diversified customer base in the various markets we serve. No commercial customer in 2025 or 2024 accounted for more than 10% of net sales for any of our segments or for the total Company.","zh":"我們在我們服務的各個市場擁有廣泛且多元化的客戶群。 2025 年或 2024 年，沒有任何商業客戶占我們任何部門或整個公司淨銷售額的 10% 以上。"},{"en":"Total sales to international customers were $2,932.6 million in 2025 and $2,731.1 million in 2024. Of these net sales to international customers, our businesses in the United States accounted for $978.4 million in 2025 and $950.0 million in 2024.","zh":"2025 年對國際客戶的總銷售額為 29.326 億美元，2024 年為 27.311 億美元。在對國際客戶的淨銷售額中，我們在美國的業務在 2025 年佔 9.784 億美元，在 2024 年佔 9.500 億美元。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Because of the diversity of products we sell and the number of markets we serve, we encounter a wide variety of competitors, none of which we believe offer the same product and service lines or serve all of the same markets as we do. Although we have certain advantages that we believe help us compete effectively in our markets, each of our markets is highly competitive. Our businesses compete on quality, product performance and reliability, technical expertise, price, and service. Many of our competitors have, and potential competitors could have, greater name recognition, a larger installed base of products, more extensive engineering, manufacturing, marketing and distribution capabilities and greater financial, technological and personnel resources than we do.","zh":"由於我們銷售的產品的多樣性和我們服務的市場的數量，我們遇到了各種各樣的競爭對手，我們認為沒有一個競爭對手能夠提供與我們相同的產品和服務線或服務所有相同的市場。儘管我們相信某些優勢有助於我們在市場中有效競爭，但我們的每個市場都競爭激烈。我們的業務在品質、產品性能和可靠性、技術專長、價格和服務方面競爭。我們的許多競爭對手和潛在競爭對手都比我們擁有更高的知名度、更大的產品安裝基礎、更廣泛的工程、製造、行銷和分銷能力以及更多的財務、技術和人力資源。"},{"en":"We own and control various intellectual property rights, including patents, trade secrets, confidential information, trademarks, trade names and copyrights. We license patents, technology and other intellectual property rights owned and controlled by others. Similarly, other companies license patents, technology and other intellectual property rights owned and controlled by us. We do not consider any single patent or trademark, or any group of them, essential either to Teledyne's business as a whole or to any one of our reportable segments. The annual royalties received or paid under license agreements are not significant to any of our reportable segments or to our overall operations.","zh":"我們擁有並控制各種智慧財產權，包括專利、商業機密、機密資訊、商標、商號和版權。我們授權他人擁有和控制的專利、技術和其他智慧財產權。同樣，其他公司也授權我們擁有和控制的專利、技術和其他智慧財產權。我們認為任何單一專利或商標或任何一組專利或商標對於 Teledyne 的整體業務或我們的任何一個可報告部門都不是至關重要的。根據許可協議收取或支付的年度特許權使用費對我們的任何可報告部門或我們的整體運營並不重要。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-28","items":[{"name":"Digital Imaging","val":3163900000,"zh":"數位影像"},{"name":"Instrumentation","val":1457100000,"zh":"儀器儀表"},{"name":"Aerospace & Defense Electronics","val":1058700000,"zh":"航空航太與國防電子"},{"name":"Engineered Systems","val":435700000,"zh":"工程系統"}],"total":6115400000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-28","items":[{"name":"US","val":3182800000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":1525800000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia","val":894400000,"zh":"亞洲"},{"name":"Countries Other Than United States Europe & Asia","val":512400000,"zh":"美國以外的國家 歐洲和亞洲"}],"total":6115400000}},"peers":["TDG","TYL","FTV","IEX","CW"]}}